cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: iEEG Normative Abnormality
abstract: Z-scores every per-channel feature of intracranial EEG recordings (band power, coherence strength, or any
  feature in the shared long table) against the normative channels of a supplied reference in the same region (an
  MNI neighbourhood or a region label), and scores edge-level coherence against normative edges between the same
  regions (Bernabei et al. 2022), with leave-one-patient-out. The reference is a feature table from any normative
  cohort or the HUP Interictal iEEG Atlas, converted with the same feature code; one step of the Interictal
  Biomarker Mapping workflow.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-ieeg-normative
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- ieeg
- seeg
- electrophysiology
- epilepsy
- normative-mapping
- statistics
